{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12203090","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12203090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1220309001:0":{"text":"あなたがラフターさんですか？お聞きしたいことがあるのですが？","source_cn":"请问你是拉夫特先生吗？我们有几个问题想找你打听。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6548D05CA67861B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220309002:0":{"text":"ネ、ネズミ！また巨大ネズミだ！！","source_cn":"老、老鼠！又是大老鼠？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62C9B24DD8038BC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220309003:0":{"text":"失礼な……メイジの使い魔に会ったことはないにしても、聞いたことくらいはありますよね？","source_cn":"真失礼……就算没有亲眼见过魔法师的使魔，起码也听说过吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x622010A10600A8EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220309004:0":{"text":"使い魔……メイジはネズミを使い魔にするのが好きなのか？じゃあ俺が見たのも、まさか使い魔だったのか？","source_cn":"使魔……魔法师都喜欢用大老鼠当使魔吗？我看见的那东西，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19AC43B8384BA9C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220309005:0":{"text":"はぁ……ラスティーアンカーの人々には、魔法の基本から教えないとダメそうですね。","source_cn":"唉……我有必要给锈锚港的人普及一些魔法常识了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FC48CEE7F940BCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220309006:0":{"text":"今のは聞かなかったことにしてください。それより、その巨大ネズミを見た場所を教えてもらえますか？","source_cn":"算了，先不说这些。你能不能告诉我们，在哪看见了大老鼠？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC34E448BB0530D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220309007:0":{"text":"ここだよ。","source_cn":"就在这里。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7F348292B92773B4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ここだよ。","female":"ここだよ。","variant_male_record_index":"132560","variant_female_record_index":"132561","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220309008:0":{"text":"日が沈んで辺りが暗くなってきた頃、その群れが壁際を走り抜けていったんだ。俺はその場で腰を抜かしてしまったよ。","source_cn":"当时天很黑，那群东西贴着墙根跑过去，吓得我踩了自己的脚！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x07477610459F68B1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"日が沈んで辺りが暗くなってきた頃、その群れが壁際を走り抜けていったんだ。俺はその場で腰を抜かしてしまったよ。","female":"日が沈んで辺りが暗くなってきた頃、その群れが壁際を走り抜けていったんだ。俺はその場で腰を抜かしてしまったよ。","variant_male_record_index":"132562","variant_female_record_index":"132563","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220309009:0":{"text":"近くに行って調べてみるよ。","source_cn":"我走近点看看。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4CDAB6873DBD29B2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"近くに行って調べてみるよ。","female":"近くに行って調べてみるよ。","variant_male_record_index":"132564","variant_female_record_index":"132565","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220309010:0":{"text":"気をつけて、ロンロン！","source_cn":"小心啊满满！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"